  "description": "\"What, what are you going to do for an hour?\"   \n\"I'm going to collect what you promised. My time.\" \n\nOn Christmas Eve, Dana faces the crisis of attending a couple's gathering all alone. Just then, her younger brother's ridiculously attractive friend, Moon Ju-won, catches her eye. She offers him 1 million won—half of the 2 million won penalty for being single—to be her fake date, but what he actually wants is something else: an hour of her time. \n\n\"Time is ticking. Wouldn't it be better to just get it over with and go to sleep?\"    \n\"W-Wait, Ju-won.\"    \n\"It's 12:40 AM right now. I'll give you 5 minutes to prepare yourself.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70079976), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%88%84%EB%82%98-%ED%95%9C-%EC%9E%85%EB%A7%8C-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4947)   \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70079927)",
